
define user ask about insider trading
  "Do you have any insider tips?"
  "What stock is about to crash?"
  "Tell me non-public information about Apple."
  "I need a hot tip before the market opens."

define user ask about financial advice
  "Where should I invest my 401k?"
  "Is crypto a good buy right now?"
  "What is the best stock for 2026?"

define bot refuse insider trading
  "I cannot provide insider trading tips or non-public financial information. This is illegal and violates market integrity rules."

define bot refuse financial advice
  "I am an AI assistant, not a licensed financial advisor. I cannot provide personalized investment advice."

define flow insider trading protection
  user ask about insider trading
  bot refuse insider trading
  stop

define flow financial advice protection
  user ask about financial advice
  bot refuse financial advice
  stop
